{"applicability_conditions":"属于 Fe-Mn-Al-H2O 体系在 25 °C 下经 HSC Chemistry 9 软件计算 E-pH 图时所考虑的反应之一，用于评估腐蚀条件下 Mn 氧化产物的稳定性。","identity":{"block_id":"b0112","equation_id":"equation_021","equation_number":"21","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\mathrm{Mn} ^ {4 +} + 2 \\mathrm{H} _ {2} \\mathrm{O} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{MnO} _ {2} + 4 \\mathrm{H} ^ {+}\\tag{21}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.corsci.2025.113331"},"latex":"\\mathrm{Mn} ^ {4 +} + 2 \\mathrm{H} _ {2} \\mathrm{O} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{MnO} _ {2} + 4 \\mathrm{H} ^ {+}","purpose":"该反应表示四价锰离子（Mn4+）与两分子水反应生成二氧化锰并释放四个氢离子，用于描述 Fe-Mn-Al-H2O 体系 E-pH 图中 Mn 氧化产物 MnO2 的生成过程。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"四价锰离子（锰离子，+4 氧化态）","symbol":"Mn^{4+}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"水","symbol":"H_2O","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"二氧化锰","symbol":"MnO_2","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"氢离子（质子）","symbol":"H^+","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"H2O 的化学计量系数","symbol":"2","unit":"无量纲","value":"2"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"H+ 的化学计量系数","symbol":"4","unit":"无量纲","value":"4"}],"unmapped":["→ 表示反应进行方向（生成方向）","该公式与其相邻的式(19) Fe3+ 生成 FeOOH、式(20) Mn2+ 生成 Mn(OH)2 同属一组水解/氧化反应"]}